{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午10時25分，警方接獲途人報案，指在西貢清水灣道有私家車失事。人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路，向左翻側倒在草坪，年約60歲的男司機已離開車廂，稍後由救護車送到將軍澳醫院治理。</p><p>據報私家車沿路往九龍，期間司機疑為避狗而扭軚，但告失事，越過對面線。</p><figure><img alt=\"人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路後翻側倒在路旁。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192800879787380736372490.jpeg/Xd-OErBsEXLI8zNy4voHuCi5D_0F2OQiWamsXnyprF4\"/><figcaption>人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路後翻側倒在路旁。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意外中私家車司機受傷，清醒送院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192801812160188416670825.jpeg/A5s-0HO1Za9tA8b2RbKlqwZs57h4PUFuFilNHxYpTR8\"/><figcaption>意外中私家車司機受傷，清醒送院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路後翻側倒在路旁。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192800882358620160493602.jpeg/GMPV3hD6_3KozHpwuY-yxkwggbWE6zogyxUcZu4VHGY\"/><figcaption>人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路後翻側倒在路旁。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路後翻側倒在路旁。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192801132649385984028519.jpeg/GOpXEPOhLh52UO4MMnLj3-VwF7kgivpR7z4tvso-Lb4\"/><figcaption>人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路後翻側倒在路旁。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路後翻側倒在路旁。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192801135048658944049852.jpeg/6mGPCugORN7k_s27HGi3_Ge2rth5BxKSXizI-V4syPk\"/><figcaption>人員到場證實私家車衝出馬路後翻側倒在路旁。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:02:23.838928+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:57:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:49.797461+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:46.239716+00:00","content_hash":"79bdb0157ce264815fce9a4805a37b3b6259ec0cfeebab4a7650c2af9d464968","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}